  - usage tokens
abstract: >-
  Research, an F0 benchmark suite, and a private inference application with
  signed nodes, transactional laboratory credits, cooperative funds and bounded
  automatic readiness renewal, demand-backed private expansion and authenticated
  model-stage RPC transport with portable contributor supervision, explicit CPU/CUDA
  selection, observed allocation budgets, and unequal model placement. The project prioritizes
  models above 27 billion parameters and documents memory, hardware, and
  communication requirements for contributed capacity. Includes local evidence
  and an economic study that rejected the fictional parameters tested.
  It is not an operational public decentralized network.
